  "releaseNotes": "2.0.4:\n      - Added: {{SiteName}} token that emits the site name from Site Settings (wrap in quotes, e.g. '{{SiteName}}').\n      - Removed: {{UserRolesJson}} token. Use '{{UserRoles}}' instead; scripts still using {{UserRolesJson}} must be updated.\n      - Updated: Admin settings hint and sample snippet document the new token.",
